op playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/27f8ef617aafc71569219408f1d69cb0.poster.avif?t=1725167794\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/27f8ef617aafc71569219408f1d69cb0.webm?t=1725167794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/f537c4af91c4f690be129e00b0604b17.avif?t=1725167794\" /></span><br>~ Swipe coins from randomly spawning targets, but beware - your greed may attract unwanted attention!<br>~ Escalating Excitement: Feel the tension rise as more police flood the streets as the match progresses.<br>~ Watch out! If the police catch you with their flashlights you will be sent to jail and lose a portion of your earnings.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/f0e57ed002aaa906b2b867c3ee486c32.poster.avif?t=1725167794\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/f0e57ed002aaa906b2b867c3ee486c32.webm?t=1725167794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/8134c6a0e2657e0d2ec00a07513e362e.avif?t=1725167794\" /></span><br>~ Multi-level Mastery: Navigate elaborate, multi-story maps that reward exploration and tactical thinking.<br>~ Interactive Environments: Ride steam cars and use elevators to outsmart your opponents and evade capture.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/45de8d9e73d3d1424482819d93da7830.avif?t=1725167794\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/c1af7ed688f45636991f87fa3b23b65e.avif?t=1725167794\" /></span><br>~ Chart your journey from novice pickpocket to master thief with our comprehensive career tracking system.<br>~ Monitor your progress across 25 different statistics, including level records like &quot;Richest Night&quot; and &quot;Highest Bail Paid.&quot;<br>~ Review your lifetime stats such as &quot;Total Nights Won&quot; and &quot;Total Gold Lost.&quot;<br>~ Learn the Ropes: Master the art of thievery with a fully voiced tutorial.<br>~ Achievements Galore: Prove your worth with a wide range of challenging achievements.<br><br>In Pick-a-Pocket, every shadow conceals an opportunity, and every coin pilfered brings you closer to underworld infamy. Will you emerge as the craftiest cutpurse, or find yourself behind bars? Gather your gang, sharpen your wits, and prepare for a night of high-stakes heists in the gaslit streets of a bygone era.<br>Can you pick your way to the top of the criminal underworld?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481440/extras/07db1c432153f3839f2809ed4b601eee.avif?t=1725167794\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "Stealth your way through Victorian-Era streets and Pickpocket your way to the top. Stay Vigilant as other thieves will be out and about, ready to steal your rewards or as easy marks to increase your stash. Avoid Bobbies, vanish from the light and disappear with your ill-gotten goods by day break.",
